    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But a therapist won't get it. They talk about \"grounding\" and \"sensory input\" like that actually matters. It doesn't change the fact that my life feels like a simulation. Everything feels so hollow and fake. Sometimes i think it would just be easier to stop trying to be \"real\" and just... fade out. Like, if i'm already just a ghost, why am i still fighting to stay in this shell?",
